{"path":"numeric/random/chi_squared_distribution","title":"std::chi_squared_distribution","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>chi_squared_distribution","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/chi_squared_distribution","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"The chi_squared_distribution produces random numbers x>0 according to the Chi-squared distribution:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/random\">&lt;random&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> RealType <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> chi_squared_distribution<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <code>chi_squared_distribution</code> produces random numbers <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small x>0\">x&gt;0</span> according to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chi-squared_distribution\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">Chi-squared distribution</a>:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small f(x;n) = }\\frac{x^{(n/2)-1}\\exp{(-x/2)} }{\\Gamma{(n/2)}2^{n/2} }\">f(x;n) = <span class=\"t-mfrac\"><table><tr><td>x<span class=\"t-su\">(n/2)-1<br></span> <i>e</i><sup>-x/2</sup></td></tr><tr><td>Γ(n/2) 2<span class=\"t-su\">n/2<br></span></td></tr></table></span></span>\n</dd></dl>\n<p><span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small\\Gamma\">Γ</span> is the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gamma_function\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">Gamma function</a> (See also <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/tgamma\">std::tgamma</a></span>) and <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small n\">n</span> are the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Degrees_of_freedom_(statistics)\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">degrees of freedom</a> (default 1).\n</p><p><a href=\"#\"><code>std::chi_squared_distribution</code></a> satisfies all requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/RandomNumberDistribution\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">RandomNumberDistribution</em></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> RealType\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> The result type generated by the generator. The effect is undefined if this is not one of <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span>, or <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span>.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>result_type</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">RealType</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>param_type</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> the type of the parameter set, see <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/RandomNumberDistribution\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">RandomNumberDistribution</em></a>.\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/chi_squ